{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25922","headline":"水殿采菱歌 · 鲍溶","name":"水殿采菱歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宫鸦叫赤光，潮声入宫宫影凉。\n火华啼露卷横塘，金堤四合宛柔扬。\n美人荷裙芙蓉妆，柔荑萦雾櫂龙航。\n采莲一声歌态长，青丝结眼捕鸳鸯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25922.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25922","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}